# MNKYBOX SSH keys template — edit this file on the FAT boot partition.
#
# Put one OpenSSH public key per line (e.g. the contents of ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub)
# and remove the leading "# " of the example line. The first-boot unit installs
# it as /root/.ssh/authorized_keys (mode 0600) and renames this file to
# authorized_keys.applied.
#
# Dropbear runs with -s: password logins are disabled, so this file is the only
# way to log in over SSH.
#
# ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAI... you@laptop
